    "created_at": "2022-08-29T11:05:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-08-29T11:05:18Z",
    "body": "While in theory this seems interesting, in practice I haven't seen a proposal for this that maintains all the good qualities of HTML syntax. Meta-syntax is just not very ergonomic (or internally consistent, at this point) and also introduces its own set of risks.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
